  "pitcher_id_data_rule": "Vocabularies per id column from the TRAIN split only (labels never read): rows dated <= 20250430 (manifest TRAIN max_date <= cutoff and every later split min_date > cutoff, checked by runner and scorer), ids with >= 100 TRAIN rows (the P38 rule, not tuned); DEV / mlb_dev never used for vocabulary, min count, width, calibration or selection. `batter` is joined by the export keys from raw statcast 2023-2025 (id columns only, no 2026 / holdout file), every row matched once and raw pitcher == export pitcher on every row; the sidecar is pinned by sha and verified per split. Row shuffle uses only the split's own batter column and a fixed seed; scorer subsets use the TRUE batter's TRAIN vocabulary membership for every arm. No 2026 rows.",
